- The convention document is published and reachable by all adopting component\n  teams.\n- The convention has been reviewed by representatives of the adopting\n  component teams with no unresolved objections to the required-field set.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): A platform logging convention is published: JSON schema,\n  required fields (timestamp, level, component, namespace, correlation id),\n  and library guidance per language (Go, Python, TypeScript).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":40398,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a8bc18897112f2d","agent_id":"a8b7c416e92542af2","session_id":"58dc5346-ca06-4598-877d-d8e47ba1db78","uuid":"39fca451-c779-4dc1-ac89-f543bf21ec02","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:10:37.495Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9011"}
